# Cloudflare redirects.
#
# IMPORTANT: this site deploys as a Cloudflare **Worker** (`wrangler deploy`
# with an [assets] directory), not as Cloudflare Pages. Workers Assets accepts
# ONLY RELATIVE URLs here — every source and destination must start with "/".
#
# An absolute cross-host rule such as
#     https://www.example.co.za/*  https://example.co.za/:splat  301
# is valid on Pages but is rejected by Workers with:
#     Invalid _redirects configuration: Only relative URLs are allowed. [100324]
# and it fails the whole deploy, not just that line.
#
# Host-level canonicalisation (www -> apex) therefore cannot live in this file.
# Do it in the Cloudflare dashboard instead: Rules -> Redirect Rules -> Create,
# matching `http.host eq "www.knoesen-accounting.co.za"` with a 301 to
# `concat("https://knoesen-accounting.co.za", http.request.uri.path)`.
# Redirect Rules are free on every plan. Simpler still: just don't attach the
# www hostname to the Worker as a custom domain, and it never resolves at all.
#
# `python build.py --check` validates this file and will fail on an absolute
# URL before it ever reaches Cloudflare.

# This site used to be a single page with anchor navigation. Those anchors are
# now real pages, so anyone arriving on an old bookmark or an indexed anchor
# link lands somewhere sensible instead of on the home page with no context.
/index.html            /                                     301
/owner                 /about                                301
/team                  /about                                301
/areas                 /areas-we-serve                       301
/blog                  /resources                            301
/blog/*                /resources                            301
/tax-rates             /resources/tax-rates-2026-2027        301
/tax-deadlines         /resources/tax-deadlines-calendar     301
/vat                   /resources/vat-registration-threshold 301
/accounting            /services/accounting                  301
/tax                   /services/tax                         301
/payroll               /services/payroll                     301
/cipc                  /services/company-secretarial         301
